### Sistem Manajemen Magang PT Logistax Mitratama Solusi — Manual API Testing
### Gunakan REST Client (VS Code) atau import ke Postman/Insomnia.
### Jalankan server dulu: php artisan serve

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@adminToken = ISI_SETELAH_LOGIN_ADMIN
@mentorToken = ISI_SETELAH_LOGIN_MENTOR
@internToken = ISI_SETELAH_LOGIN_INTERN
@divisionId = ISI_UUID_DIVISI
@mentorId = ISI_UUID_MENTOR
@internId = ISI_UUID_INTERN
@officeLatitude = -6.1753924
@officeLongitude = 106.8271528
@attendanceId = ISI_UUID_ATTENDANCE
@evaluationId = ISI_UUID_EVALUATION
@mentor2Token = ISI_SETELAH_LOGIN_MENTOR_LAIN


### =========================
### AUTH
### =========================

### Login Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@logistax.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register Intern (self, mobile app)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/intern/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "intern1@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "nim": "12345678",
  "institution": "Universitas Indonesia",
  "major": "Informatika",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2026-06-01"
}

### Login Intern
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/intern/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "intern1@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Logout (pakai token admin atau intern)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================
### DIVISIONS (admin_magang only)
### =========================

### List divisions
GET {{baseUrl}}/divisions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create division
POST {{baseUrl}}/divisions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "IT Support"
}

### Update division
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/divisions/{{divisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "IT & Infrastructure"
}

### Soft-delete division (fails if still used by an intern)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/divisions/{{divisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================
### OFFICE LOCATIONS (admin_magang only)
### =========================

### List office locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/office-locations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create office location
POST {{baseUrl}}/office-locations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kantor Pusat Tangerang",
  "latitude": -6.1783,
  "longitude": 106.6319,
  "radius_meters": 100
}

### Update office location
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/office-locations/{{divisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "radius_meters": 150
}

### Soft-delete office location
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/office-locations/{{divisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================
### INTERNS
### =========================

### List interns (admin_magang: semua, spv_mentor: hanya miliknya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/interns?page=1&search=budi&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create intern langsung oleh admin (status langsung active)
POST {{baseUrl}}/interns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "intern2@test.com",
  "full_name": "Siti Aminah",
  "nim": "87654321",
  "institution": "Universitas Gadjah Mada",
  "major": "Sistem Informasi",
  "phone": "081298765432",
  "division_id": "{{divisionId}}",
  "mentor_id": "{{mentorId}}",
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2026-06-01"
}

### Detail intern
GET {{baseUrl}}/interns/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update data dasar intern
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interns/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "081200000000"
}

### Approve intern (hanya status pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/interns/{{internId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "division_id": "{{divisionId}}",
  "mentor_id": "{{mentorId}}"
}

### Reject intern (hanya status pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/interns/{{internId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Data institusi tidak valid"
}

### Extend masa magang
POST {{baseUrl}}/interns/{{internId}}/extend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "new_end_date": "2026-08-01",
  "reason": "Kinerja baik, diperpanjang 2 bulan"
}

### Mark failed (hanya status active/extended)
POST {{baseUrl}}/interns/{{internId}}/mark-failed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Melanggar aturan perusahaan"
}

### Mark completed (hanya status active/extended)
POST {{baseUrl}}/interns/{{internId}}/mark-completed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================
### ATTENDANCE — INTERN (middleware intern.auth)
### =========================

### Check-in (dalam radius kantor -> pakai koordinat office_location persis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": {{officeLatitude}},
  "longitude": {{officeLongitude}}
}

### Check-in di luar radius (harus ditolak: "Lokasi Anda di luar radius kantor yang terdaftar.")
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -6.9,
  "longitude": 107.6
}

### Check-in dobel hari yang sama (harus ditolak: "Anda sudah check-in hari ini.")
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": {{officeLatitude}},
  "longitude": {{officeLongitude}}
}

### Check-out (dalam radius, sudah check-in sebelumnya)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": {{officeLatitude}},
  "longitude": {{officeLongitude}}
}

### Ajukan izin (tanpa proof_file — opsional untuk izin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/leave-request
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="date"

2026-09-25
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

izin
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Ada acara keluarga
--WebAppBoundary--

### Ajukan sakit TANPA proof_file (harus ditolak — wajib untuk sakit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/leave-request
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="date"

2026-09-26
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

sakit
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Demam tinggi
--WebAppBoundary--

### Ajukan sakit DENGAN proof_file
### Catatan: baris "< ./storage/app/public/.gitignore" di bawah cuma placeholder
### (REST Client file-injection syntax) supaya request valid tanpa file tambahan.
### Ganti dengan path file jpg/png/pdf asli saat testing sungguhan, contoh:
### < ./scratch/surat_sakit.pdf
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/leave-request
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="date"

2026-09-26
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

sakit
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Demam tinggi, ada surat dokter
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="proof_file"; filename="surat_sakit.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./storage/app/public/.gitignore
--WebAppBoundary--

### Riwayat absensi saya (default bulan berjalan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/my-history
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}

### Riwayat absensi saya (filter bulan & tahun tertentu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/my-history?month=9&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}


### =========================
### ATTENDANCE — ADMIN (admin_magang & spv_mentor, di-scope di controller)
### =========================

### Rekap bulanan per intern (admin_magang: semua, spv_mentor: hanya bimbingannya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/monthly-report?month=9&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rekap bulanan filter division & intern tertentu
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/monthly-report?month=9&year=2026&division_id={{divisionId}}&intern_id={{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List pengajuan izin/sakit yang masih pending (include proof_file_url)
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/pending-approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Setujui pengajuan (hanya kalau approval_status = pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tolak pengajuan (reason wajib, digabung ke kolom notes tanpa menimpa catatan asli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Surat dokter tidak jelas, mohon upload ulang"
}

### spv_mentor coba approve intern yang BUKAN bimbingannya (harus 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}


### =========================
### EVALUATIONS (admin_magang & spv_mentor, hak & scope di controller)
### =========================

### List intern yang perlu segera dinilai (belum ada evaluation, status active/extended,
### end_date <= 7 hari dari sekarang atau sudah lewat). admin_magang: semua, spv_mentor: bimbingannya saja
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List pending dengan window custom (misal 14 hari)
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/pending?within_days=14
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}

### Buat evaluasi baru — hanya mentor intern tsb ATAU admin_magang
### total_score & grade SELALU dihitung server-side (dikirim di body pun diabaikan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intern_id": "{{internId}}",
  "discipline_score": 90,
  "performance_score": 85,
  "attitude_score": 88,
  "communication_score": 92,
  "comments": "Kinerja sangat baik selama masa magang"
}

### Buat evaluasi lagi untuk intern yang SAMA (harus ditolak — sudah ada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intern_id": "{{internId}}",
  "discipline_score": 50,
  "performance_score": 50,
  "attitude_score": 50,
  "communication_score": 50
}

### spv_mentor coba buat evaluasi untuk intern yang BUKAN bimbingannya (harus 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluations
Authorization: Bearer {{mentor2Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intern_id": "{{internId}}",
  "discipline_score": 80,
  "performance_score": 80,
  "attitude_score": 80,
  "communication_score": 80
}

### --- Skenario PATCH: mentor yang SAMA dengan evaluated_by, belum ada certificate -> boleh edit bebas
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discipline_score": 95,
  "comments": "Direvisi setelah diskusi lanjutan"
}

### --- Skenario PATCH: spv_mentor LAIN (bukan evaluated_by) -> harus 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mentor2Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discipline_score": 10
}

### --- Skenario PATCH: admin_magang edit (kapan saja) -> edited_by_admin=true, last_edited_by=admin id
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "performance_score": 100
}

### --- Skenario PATCH: setelah certificate terbit untuk intern ini, mentor (evaluated_by sekalipun) -> 403
### Catatan: buat certificate dulu manual via tinker sebelum test ini (belum ada endpoint certificate di fase ini)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discipline_score": 50
}

### --- Skenario PATCH: setelah certificate terbit, admin_magang tetap boleh edit
### -> needs_certificate_regeneration jadi true, certificate LAMA tidak dihapus di sini
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attitude_score": 70
}

### Lihat evaluasi 1 intern (admin bebas, spv_mentor hanya kalau dia mentornya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/intern/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### spv_mentor coba lihat evaluasi intern yang BUKAN bimbingannya (harus 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/intern/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mentor2Token}}


### =========================
### EVALUATION — INTERN (middleware intern.auth)
### =========================

### Lihat evaluasi sendiri (kalau sudah dinilai)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}

### Lihat evaluasi sendiri kalau BELUM ada (return data null + message, BUKAN 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}


### =========================
### CERTIFICATES — ADMIN (admin_magang only untuk generate/regenerate/preview)
### =========================

### Preview sertifikat (nomor DUMMY, TANPA password, TIDAK menyimpan apa pun ke DB/counter)
### Response berupa file PDF langsung, bukan JSON — buka manual/save-as di REST Client.
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/preview/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Generate sertifikat pertama kali — syarat: intern.status = completed, evaluation lengkap
POST {{baseUrl}}/certificates/generate/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Generate lagi untuk intern yang SAMA (certificate sudah ada, flag regenerate=false -> harus ditolak)
POST {{baseUrl}}/certificates/generate/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Generate untuk intern berstatus 'failed' (harus ditolak dengan pesan jelas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/certificates/generate/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Regenerate manual (admin boleh kapan saja selama certificate sudah ada,
### tidak dibatasi hanya saat needs_certificate_regeneration = true — lihat README)
POST {{baseUrl}}/certificates/regenerate/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Regenerate untuk intern yang BELUM PERNAH punya certificate (harus ditolak)
POST {{baseUrl}}/certificates/regenerate/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### spv_mentor coba akses endpoint generate (route admin_magang only -> harus 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/certificates/generate/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}


### =========================
### CERTIFICATES — ADMIN & MENTOR (metadata + download, scope di controller)
### =========================

### Lihat metadata sertifikat (BUKAN file PDF) — admin bebas, spv_mentor hanya bimbingannya
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### spv_mentor LAIN (bukan mentornya) coba lihat metadata -> harus 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/{{internId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mentor2Token}}

### Download file PDF (password = NIM intern), increment download_count setiap diakses
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/{{internId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Download untuk intern berstatus 'failed' -> harus ditolak
GET {{baseUrl}}/certificates/{{internId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =========================
### CERTIFICATE — INTERN (middleware intern.auth)
### =========================

### Lihat metadata sertifikat sendiri (kalau sudah ada)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-certificate
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}

### Lihat metadata sertifikat sendiri kalau BELUM ada (data null + message, BUKAN 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-certificate
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}

### Download sertifikat sendiri
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-certificate/download
Authorization: Bearer {{internToken}}
